        {
          "exampleId": "w:used#e-9281e8c7527eca52",
          "text": "But one question has been on my mind a lot lately: is it better to buy new eco-friendly products or used traditionally produced goods?",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2021-eight-provinces-jan",
            "paperTitle": "2021年1月八省联考英语",
            "groupId": "group:paper-gaokao-2021-eight-provinces-jan:reading-b",
            "locator": {
              "paragraph": 1,
              "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2021-eight-provinces-jan:reading-b:1",
              "sentence": 5
            }
          },
          "tier": "gaokao",
          "target": {
            "start": 100,
            "end": 104
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:used#e-9fc37bc4f1cb6e81",
          "text": "Things like dishes, clothes and furniture fall into the “secondary footprint” group, so less is more and we can focus on finding used goods to avoid the added production.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2021-eight-provinces-jan",
            "paperTitle": "2021年1月八省联考英语",
            "groupId": "group:paper-gaokao-2021-eight-provinces-jan:reading-b",
            "locator": {
              "paragraph": 4,
              "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2021-eight-provinces-jan:reading-b:4",
              "sentence": 2
            }
          },
          "tier": "gaokao",
          "target": {
            "start": 129,
            "end": 133
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:used#e-46dc7ea6921495d2",
          "text": "It’s the best way to get rid of your used clothes, score clothes from your friends, and have a party all at the same time.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2021-national-a",
            "paperTitle": "2021年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（全国甲卷）",
            "groupId": "group:paper-gaokao-2021-national-a:seven-choices",
