          "exampleId": "w:used#e-4f17b7abfc1825ea",
          "text": "While the younger generations prefer to communicate visually, for those used to working with traditional tools like email, it may feel like a learning curve(曲线).",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2020-national-ii",
            "paperTitle": "2020年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试英语（全国Ⅱ卷）",
